Package: omie2fdata
Type: Package
Title: Download and Convert OMIE Market Data to Functional Data
Version: 0.0.2
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Manuel",
           family = "Oviedo de la Fuente",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "manuel.oviedo@udc.es",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-7360-3249"))
Description: Downloads and reads public electricity-market data from OMIE
    (Operador del Mercado Iberico de Energia) and converts daily trajectories
    into functional data objects ('fdata' and 'ldata') from the 'fda.usc'
    package. It supports the consolidated day-ahead market-results files and
    direct public-repository files such as 'marginalpdbc', local or temporary
    downloads, hourly data, and quarter-hourly data from 1 October 2025.
License: GPL-2
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 3.5.0)
Imports: fda.usc, tools, utils
Suggests: knitr, rmarkdown, testthat (>= 3.0.0)
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
URL: https://moviedo5.github.io/omie2fdata,
    https://github.com/moviedo5/omie2fdata
BugReports: https://github.com/moviedo5/omie2fdata/issues
